(SUNRISE APARTMENTS) Tj T*
(RESIDENTIAL LEASE AGREEMENT) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This Lease Agreement \("Lease"\) is entered into between Sunrise Apartments LLC \("Landlord"\)) Tj T*
(and the undersigned Tenant, for the residential unit located at 42 Maple Court, Unit 3B.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. TERM. This Lease begins on the Commencement Date and continues for an initial term of) Tj T*
(twelve \(12\) months. Thereafter, this Lease shall automatically renew for successive twelve) Tj T*
(\(12\) month terms unless Tenant provides Landlord with written notice of non-renewal at least) Tj T*
(ninety \(90\) days prior to the end of the then-current term. Failure to provide timely notice) Tj T*
(obligates Tenant to the full subsequent term regardless of Tenant's intent to vacate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. RENT AND LATE FEES. Rent is due in full on the 1st day of each month. Any payment) Tj T*
(received after the 1st shall incur a late fee equal to ten percent \(10%\) of the monthly) Tj T*
(rent, assessed for each day the payment remains outstanding, with no grace period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. SECURITY DEPOSIT. Tenant shall pay a security deposit equal to three \(3\) months' rent) Tj T*
(prior to occupancy. Landlord may deduct any amount from the deposit for "general wear and) Tj T*
(tear" or "cleaning and restoration" at Landlord's sole and absolute discretion, and Landlord) Tj T*
(is under no obligation to provide Tenant with an itemized list of such deductions or) Tj T*
(supporting receipts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. MAINTENANCE AND REPAIRS. Tenant shall be solely responsible for all maintenance and) Tj T*
(repairs to the unit during the term of this Lease, including but not limited to structural) Tj T*
(repairs, plumbing, electrical systems, and appliances, regardless of the cause of the defect) Tj T*
(or damage.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. EARLY TERMINATION. Tenant may not terminate this Lease early for any reason, including) Tj T*
(but not limited to job relocation, medical hardship, or change in family circumstances.) Tj T*
(Should Tenant vacate the premises prior to the end of the term, Tenant shall remain liable) Tj T*
(for all remaining rent payments due under the Lease, in addition to an early termination) Tj T*
(penalty equal to two \(2\) months' rent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. RIGHT OF ENTRY. Landlord reserves the right to enter the premises at any time, for any) Tj T*
(purpose, without providing advance notice to Tenant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. GOVERNING LAW. This Lease shall be governed by the laws of the state in which the) Tj T*
(property is located.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Lease as of the date first written above.) Tj T*
